      "ruleId": "ias-34-r002",
      "paragraphReference": "IAS 34.15",
      "ruleText": "An entity shall include in its interim financial report an explanation of events and transactions that are significant to an understanding of the changes in financial position and performance of the entity since the end of the last annual reporting period.",
