      "ruleId": "ias-34-r003",
      "paragraphReference": "IAS 34.28",
      "ruleText": "An entity shall include a reconciliation of income tax expense for the interim period to the applicable tax rate on annual earnings, explaining the relationship between the interim tax expense and the annual tax rate.",
