      "ruleId": "ias-34-r004",
      "paragraphReference": "IAS 34.37",
      "ruleText": "An entity shall assess at each interim reporting date whether there is any indication that an asset may be impaired, and if so, shall determine the recoverable amount and recognise an impairment loss in the interim period.",
